Subject: Retarget vendored knative.dev/pkg semconv import to OpenTelemetry semconv v1.43.0
Origin: DHI-internal (OpenTelemetry SDK compatibility for the knative-v1.22 vendor tree)
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/knative/serving 3bd82a6177c278b1192abee1b3ca39daf25c3f35
Verify: cmd `go build -mod=vendor ./cmd/... && echo build-ok` expect "build-ok"
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI build compatibility change; the knative-v1.22 release train is pinned)
Drop-When: upstream >= 1.23.0 (knative-v1.23.0 builds without this change)

The knative-v1.22 vendor tree imports semconv v1.40.0 in knative.dev/pkg/observability/semconv. Once go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk is bumped to v1.45.0, the vendored tree no longer contains semconv v1.41.0, so this import is retargeted to v1.43.0, the semconv package that SDK vendors. The change is a single import path in one file; the rest of the file is untouched.

diff --git a/vendor/knative.dev/pkg/observability/semconv/semconv.go b/vendor/knative.dev/pkg/observability/semconv/semconv.go
--- a/vendor/knative.dev/pkg/observability/semconv/semconv.go
+++ b/vendor/knative.dev/pkg/observability/semconv/semconv.go
@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@
 
 import (
 	"go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute"
-	semconv "go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.40.0"
+	semconv "go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.43.0"
 )
 
 const (
